==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mini Angel Cyclone]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*15 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Tarsiriel]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shachiko]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is fairly simple and basically just a [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] playground. At the start of the stage, use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] to wall the Mini Angel Cyclone while using your regular peon clearers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] to clear them out. After you kill the Mini Angel Cyclone with a bit of help from [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]], you should now have enough money to send out Soractes and start Soracting all over this stage. Soractes will juggle the Sir Rels while dealing heavy damage to both the Shachiko and the Dogensteins, and given you're using Ramen the Cala Maria can't do much. Make sure to constantly spam Guards while this is going on to get much-needed damage knockbacks onto Shachiko and to make sure the Oldhorn dies as fast as possible. If Shachiko is annoying you too much, you can use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to use the Oldhorn as a stepping stone to get damage knockbacks onto Shachiko. From there, just kill Shachiko, ignore the Cala Maria that tries to work as anti-cheese and the stage is done.

